> The USS Enterprise-D is on a deep-space survey near the Romulan Neutral Zone. Coordinate any sensor sweeps with Data before adjusting sensor gain.

--- 0b75b878-be80-8789-947e-32dbd1d21be8
<div id="m-0b75b878-be80-8789-947e-32dbd1d21be8" data-section-uuid="0b75b878-be80-8789-947e-32dbd1d21be8" class="msg msg--notion">

[Geordi La Forge](mailto:geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid "Geordi La Forge <geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>") · <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2369-04-15T01:00:00Z" title="2369-04-15 01:00:00 UTC">Tue Apr 15th, 2369 at 01:00</time>

Recommend we lower sensor gain to avoid tipping off the Romulans.

</div>

--- 0b75b87d-5260-8b4d-85ae-d86bbfcc6a45
<div id="m-0b75b87d-5260-8b4d-85ae-d86bbfcc6a45" data-section-uuid="0b75b87d-5260-8b4d-85ae-d86bbfcc6a45" class="msg msg--notion">

[Data](mailto:data@enterprise.starfleet.invalid "Data <data@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>") · <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2369-04-15T01:05:00Z" title="2369-04-15 01:05:00 UTC">Tue Apr 15th, 2369 at 01:05</time>

Concur, Commander. Reducing gain by 30%.

</div>

