<h1 class="page-title" data-page-title-uuid="0b75b842-ba60-80f0-ab79-7448df7f2124">Incident Log: Stardate 47988.1 <a class="source-link" href="https://www.notion.so/b1d6e00017014d008000000000000003" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">↗</a></h1>

[Bridge Operations Handbook](/chat/0b75b842-ba60-8131-881b-f4b981d5c44a)

## Audit

Reviewing tickets logged against the warp coil since <time datetime="2369-04-08">Tue Apr 8th, 2369</time>. [Geordi La Forge](mailto:geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid "Geordi La Forge <geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>") owns the audit; Data cross-checks the plasma readings.

- Plasma flow irregularity, see https://incident-tracker.starfleet.invalid/issue/NCC-1701-D-17 — closed.
  - Root cause: a misaligned injector on the third nacelle coil.
- Holodeck safety override, see incident-tracker.starfleet.invalid/issue/NCC-1701-D-23 — in progress.
  - Barclay's program bypassed the safeties twice; both times nobody was hurt.

## Planning

1. Schedule diagnostic with [Geordi La Forge](mailto:geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid "Geordi La Forge <geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>") by 0900 hours.
2. Brief [Jean-Luc Picard](mailto:jean-luc.picard@enterprise.starfleet.invalid "Jean-Luc Picard <jean-luc.picard@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>") before alpha shift.
   1. Bring the injector trace.
   2. Bring the holodeck override log.

## Reflection

> There are four lights.

Reminder of yesterday's tactical drill — see [Bridge Operations Handbook](/chat/0b75b842-ba60-8131-881b-f4b981d5c44a) for standing orders.

---

End of log. Signed: **William T. Riker, First Officer.**
