<h1 class="page-title" data-page-title-uuid="0b75b842-ba60-88dd-b090-baf44d88db59">Shift Roster <a class="source-link" href="https://www.notion.so/b1d6e00017014d008000000000000002" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">↗</a></h1>

[Bridge Operations Handbook](/chat/0b75b842-ba60-8131-881b-f4b981d5c44a)

Alpha shift staffing for <time datetime="2369-04-15">Tue Apr 15th, 2369</time>, posted by [Jean-Luc Picard](mailto:jean-luc.picard@enterprise.starfleet.invalid "Jean-Luc Picard <jean-luc.picard@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>").

### Alpha shift

- **Bridge:** Jean-Luc Picard, William T. Riker
  - Riker takes the conn while the captain meets the Cardassian envoy.
- **Engineering:** [Geordi La Forge](mailto:geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid "Geordi La Forge <geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>")
  - Two junior engineers on the plasma conduits until the coil audit closes.
- **Tactical:** Worf
- **Sickbay:** [Beverly Crusher](mailto:beverly.crusher@enterprise.starfleet.invalid "Beverly Crusher <beverly.crusher@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>"), with Nurse Ogawa on call.

### Beta shift

- **Bridge:** [Data](mailto:data@enterprise.starfleet.invalid "Data <data@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>") in command, Ensign Ro at conn.
- **Engineering:** Lieutenant Barclay, on light duty.

### Swaps

Cross-reference with [Bridge Operations Handbook](/chat/0b75b842-ba60-8131-881b-f4b981d5c44a) before swapping stations. A swap the duty officer has not countersigned does not stand.

- [ ] Barclay to beta shift once Counselor Troi signs off
- [x] Ro Laren to conn from <time datetime="2369-04-16">Wed Apr 16th, 2369</time> → <time datetime="2369-04-18">Fri Apr 18th, 2369</time>
